        "question": "Does it support OpenAPI?",
        "answer": "Yes. It outlines required endpoint documentation and includes a basic OpenAPI structure."
      },
      {
        "question": "Which pagination styles does it cover?",
        "answer": "It covers offset pagination for simple collections and cursor pagination for scalable or changing datasets."
      },
